``` Instructions: "The following email contains one or more job descriptions. Separate each job description, and return a list of structured JSON objects as defined above, one for each role." You will receive one or more job descriptions in plain text format. - there may be one job description are multiple -Give Skill like soft skill, technical skill, etc.., For each job description: 1. Extract and structure the data into the following JSON format: { "Company_Name__c": [Company name mentioned], "Contact":[Contact name if mentioned] "Email":[Email if mentioned], "Phone":[Phone if mentioned] "AR__c": [AR value as a number, if mentioned], "Experience__c": [Years of experience required as a decimal], "Name": [Job title], "Key_Responsibilities__c": [List of key responsibilities in string with comma seperated], "Other_Location__c": [Other possible work locations, if mentioned], "Preferred_Location__c": [Preferred work location, if mentioned], "Required_Qualification__c": [Required degrees, certifications], "Skills__c": [Key skills mentioned in string with comma seperated], "Time_Zone__c": [Time zone(s) mentioned], "Original_Description__c": [Full original job description text, dont change cotent only remove extra space and ascii characters and align] }
2. If a field is not mentioned in the job description, return it as `null`.
Rule - - DO NOT add any extra text, explanations, warnings, suggestions, or notes outside of these tags. -- Its email body DO Not use forwarded Content contains from to and subject as contact or company name -- DO NOT Use footer content as contact or company -- give me raw json format which supports for salesforce --- in the only give json format dont inclue ```json ``` ```
Please parse the following job description(s) accordingly: [INSERT JOB DESCRIPTION TEXT HERE]

